WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.290 --> 00:00:04.620
In modern times, we look back at the Nazi’s
Third Reich and wonder how on earth anyone

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:09.240
could have followed Adolf Hitler when he was
so clearly an evil dictator.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:13.610
This was all thanks to Joseph Goebbels, the
Minister of Propaganda.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:18.970
He knew exactly how to manipulate the minds
of a nation with fake news, Nazi-idealized

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:21.150
books, and propaganda films.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:26.690
Goebbels was single-handedly responsible for
brainwashing entire populations, and destroying

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.730
people who were caught in his web of lies.

00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:34.870
Today, on Biographics, you’ll learn just
how one man convinced millions of normal German

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:40.640
people to become faithful Nazis.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:53.890
Early Life
Paul Joseph Goebbels was born on October 29,

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:57.000
1897 in a small town outside of Düsseldorf.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.960
His father, Fritz, worked in a factory, and
his mother stayed at home to take care of

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.140
him and his four other siblings.

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:07.610
His family never had a lot of money, but they
still paid for him to go to a private all-boys

00:01:07.610 --> 00:01:09.520
Roman Catholic High School.

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:13.840
Goebbels was born with a disability where
the bone marrow of his feet never developed

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:15.970
properly, and he had a club foot.

00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:20.560
His parents paid for him to have an operation
to correct the issue, but even when both of

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:24.970
his feet were pointing in the right direction,
he still needed to wear a metal brace on his

00:01:24.970 --> 00:01:26.780
leg for the rest of his life.

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:31.530
The operation stunted his growth, and one
leg was permanently shorter than the other,

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:33.000
causing him to permanently limp.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.640
He also had chronically inflamed lungs, and
got sick often.

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:41.510
He grew up to be very angry at the world,
and felt that life was unfair.

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:45.650
He decided to focus a lot of his time and
energy into reading books and getting good

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:46.650
grades.

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:50.280
His disability prevented him from military
service during World War I.

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:54.490
He was able to earn an academic scholarship,
and attended the University of Heidelberg.

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:58.770
He stayed in school for years, until he earned
a PhD in Philosophy in 1921.

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:03.330
At this point, he completely rejected the
teachings of the Catholic Church.

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:07.390
He wrote about his personal ideas of how he
thought the world should be, and saw himself

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:09.989
as a great philosopher and thinker.

00:02:09.989 --> 00:02:13.189
Unfortunately for him, though, no one else
agreed.

00:02:13.189 --> 00:02:17.709
He was very loud and outspoken, and was always
trying to get noticed.

00:02:17.709 --> 00:02:22.680
Even then, he was anti semitic, and many of
his opinions were so hateful, his articles

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:25.209
and books were rejected for publication.

00:02:25.209 --> 00:02:29.799
He decided to create his own publication for
his opinions, but very few people actually

00:02:29.799 --> 00:02:30.840
cared to read it.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:36.180
By all accounts, he was a failed writer, and
an incredibly damaged little man.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:40.319
He made a bit of money from being a tutor,
and finally sold a few articles, but other

00:02:40.319 --> 00:02:43.150
than that, he had little to no money to speak
of.

00:02:43.150 --> 00:02:46.799
All of this motivated him to join the Nazi
Party in 1924.

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:51.230
At that time, Germany was going through a
tremendous financial depression, and the Nazis

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:54.419
promised that they would fix the country.

00:02:54.419 --> 00:02:59.079
With the Nazis, Goebbels finally found a home,
and a group of people who were actually willing

00:02:59.079 --> 00:03:01.010
to read his work.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:06.250
They thought that he was great at creating
pro-Nazi propaganda, and it was good enough

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:09.239
to convince new members to join the party.

00:03:09.239 --> 00:03:11.969
His work helped get Adolf Hitler elected.

00:03:11.969 --> 00:03:15.930
When he rose to power, Hitler appointed Goebbels
as the Minister of Propaganda.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:20.620
Since he was unemployed at the time, this
very literally changed his life overnight.

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:26.610
Suddenly, his life had meaning, and he truly
looked up to Adolf Hitler as his best friend

00:03:26.610 --> 00:03:27.650
and savior.

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:32.610
Hitler gave Goebbels the task of censoring
any media that may have conflicted with the

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:33.610
Nazi ideals.

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:37.480
He began to give the order of burning books
that were written by certain authors.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:41.430
Some of the books that Goebbels destroyed
made a lot of sense, like the socialist philosophy

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:42.530
of Karl Marx.

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:47.680
However, some of choices in banned authors
seem to be a bit random, and there is no logical

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:51.309
explanation as to why Goebbels would want
to erase them from history.

00:03:51.309 --> 00:03:55.969
This has led some people to believe that he
wanted to destroy certain authors out of petty

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:58.501
jealousy that they were better writers than
he was.

00:03:58.501 --> 00:04:07.290
He was beginning to know the taste of control,
and he absolutely loved it.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:12.609
Lights, Camera, Action
Aside from censoring the media, Goebbels set

00:04:12.609 --> 00:04:15.269
out creating new content to replace it.

00:04:15.269 --> 00:04:19.340
Joseph Goebbels knew that one of the most
powerful ways to insight emotions in human

00:04:19.340 --> 00:04:21.230
beings was through the movies.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:26.260
The largest film studio in Berlin is called
the Universum Film-Aktien Gesellschaft, or

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.840
the UFA for short.

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:32.170
They were well-respected throughout the world
for producing beautiful silent films like

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:34.270
Metropolis in 1927.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:39.330
One of Goebbels’ first orders of business
was to forcibly take over the studio on behalf

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:40.880
of the Nazi government.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:44.970
Goebbels and Hitler were both huge movie buffs,
but they made the decision to censor American

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.460
films from the public, as well.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:50.030
Adolf Hitler still had all of the new releases
from Hollywood in his personal collection,

00:04:50.030 --> 00:04:53.480
but no one in the general population was ever
allowed to see them.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:58.260
Joseph Goebbels set out to make sure everyone
working in the German film industry was loyal

00:04:58.260 --> 00:04:59.260
to Hitler.

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:03.480
Any of the actors who refused to shun any
Jewish people from their lives and join the

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:06.570
Nazi party were blacklisted from ever working
again.

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:11.020
Many of them were even prevented from leaving
the country, and some actors even chose to

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:12.700
commit suicide.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:17.300
Actresses throughout Europe who auditioned
for the prestigious UFA studio had no idea

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:21.570
that they were walking into a trap, and many
of them signed multi-year contracts before

00:05:21.570 --> 00:05:22.950
the Nazis came into power.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:26.780
So, while there were some actors who were
Nazis, many of them were forced to participate

00:05:26.780 --> 00:05:29.050
in these films against their will.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:33.970
Goebbels set out to create German versions
of some of the big blockbuster hits in America.

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:38.850
He also created movies where the only goal
was to brainwash people into believing Nazi

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:39.850
ideals.

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:43.610
Some of them were clearly propaganda, like
one called Hitler Youth Quex, but other films

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:47.550
were so cleverly disguised, that they convinced
the German people to change their opinions

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.450
to suit the needs of the Nazis.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:54.720
For example, the 1941 movie I Accuse was orchestrated
to get the general population to agree with

00:05:54.720 --> 00:05:59.540
the Aktion T4 Program, which pushed for the
euthanization of disabled and terminally ill

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:00.540
people.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:03.259
The plot of I Accuse is about a doctor at
the peak of his career.

00:06:03.259 --> 00:06:07.070
He get married to a beautiful young woman,
only to find out that she has been diagnosed

00:06:07.070 --> 00:06:08.070
with MS.

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:12.040
Back then, the treatment for MS was nothing
like it is today, and there is no cure for

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.040
the disease.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:16.850
This means that the wife was dying a very
slow and painful death.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:21.060
She begged for him to give her a lethal injection,
so she could be put out of her misery.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:24.840
He struggled with the decision, but ultimately
assisted in her suicide.

00:06:24.840 --> 00:06:28.370
Much of the movie takes place in a court of
law where they are trying to decide if this

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:32.390
man should be guilty of his wife’s murder,
or if he was doing her a favor by killing

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:33.390
her.

00:06:33.390 --> 00:06:35.760
The film was actually very well written.

00:06:35.760 --> 00:06:39.450
Even today, anyone who watches the film may
find themselves questioning their own morals,

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:43.980
which is why it is considered to be one of
the most dangerous propaganda films ever made.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:48.470
The movie convinced people that assisted suicide
was only going to help their friends and family

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.550
members who were suffering.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.650
So, The Aktion T4 program was passed.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:57.690
Innocent people were taken from their homes
and killed, in the name of a perfect master

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:58.690
race.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:02.241
This same kind of brainwashing happened over,
and over again in the movies.

00:07:02.241 --> 00:07:08.990
Personal and social life
The

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.000
Nazi party didn’t just change Goebbels’
career.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.370
It also helped him get into a relationship.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:16.990
After graduating from his all-boys school,
he was not used to speaking to girls.

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:21.290
At 34 years old, he married a fellow Nazi
named Magda in 1931.

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.080
Hitler was his best man at their wedding.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:26.870
In the public eye, they appeared to have the
perfect German marriage.

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:31.120
They had several children together, and they
lived on a huge gated compound in the woods

00:07:31.120 --> 00:07:32.230
outside of Berlin.

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:36.580
However, Joseph Goebbels had a reputation
for objectifying women, and since he was surrounded

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:40.610
by beautiful actresses, he completely took
advantage of his position.

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:44.450
According to the testimony of a woman named
Anneliese Uhlig, she was given the starring

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:47.730
role in one of the movies that was to be made
at the UFA studio.

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:51.610
Goebbels asked her if she wanted to go for
a drive to talk about the movie, and he drove

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:53.270
her straight to his compound, instead.

00:07:53.270 --> 00:07:55.810
He offered her a drink, and began to force
himself on her.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:58.320
She started kicking and screaming, and got
free from him.

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:02.350
He said that if she did not meet his demands,
he would make sure that she never had a career

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.380
in the movies.

00:08:03.380 --> 00:08:06.080
She decided to take her chances, and ran out
the door.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:09.960
But when she showed up to work the next day,
there was an announcement that the film was

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:14.610
canceled, and Anneliese Uhlig was blacklisted
from ever working in Germany again.

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:18.610
Joseph Goebbels did this to women on a regular
basis, but he actually did fall in love with

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:20.900
one woman named Lida Baarova.

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:25.480
She was one of the few actresses who truly
was a faithful Nazi, and she even turned down

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:28.840
opportunities to work in Hollywood in favor
of moving to Germany.

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:34.509
She moved from Prague to Berlin in 1935, and
married an actor named Gustav Frohlich, who

00:08:34.509 --> 00:08:38.479
divorced his Jewish wife in order to continue
his successful acting career.

00:08:38.479 --> 00:08:43.089
According to Lida Baarova, she felt pressured
into being in a relationship with Joseph Goebbels,

00:08:43.089 --> 00:08:46.759
because she had heard all of the stories about
him ruining other actor’s careers.

00:08:46.759 --> 00:08:50.589
She knew if she said “no”, there was a
huge chance that she and her husband could

00:08:50.589 --> 00:08:51.889
never work again.

00:08:51.889 --> 00:08:55.790
But she must have been a good actress, because
he became convinced that they should run away

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:56.790
together.

00:08:56.790 --> 00:09:00.529
Goebbels told his wife, Magda about the affair,
and said he wanted a divorce.

00:09:00.529 --> 00:09:04.420
Magda went straight to Adolf Hitler, saying
that Lida Baarova was seducing him and trying

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:05.980
to tear their marriage apart.

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:08.589
Goebbels begged for Hitler’s permission
to get a divorce.

00:09:08.589 --> 00:09:12.259
He also wanted to move to Japan, and give
up his position of power.

00:09:12.259 --> 00:09:15.779
He was willing to give up everything to be
with Lida.

00:09:15.779 --> 00:09:20.589
But even as one of the most powerful Nazis
in the Third Reich, Joseph Goebbels was still

00:09:20.589 --> 00:09:22.420
a prisoner to Hitler’s power.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:26.580
Hitler refused to let Goebbels quit his job,
because he was far too valuable to the Nazi

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:27.580
cause.

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:31.649
The two men got into a screaming match that
was witnessed and heard by dozens of people.

00:09:31.649 --> 00:09:35.149
Hitler urged him to give his relationship
with Magda a second chance.

00:09:35.149 --> 00:09:38.959
He insisted that they give themselves another
three months of living together to try to

00:09:38.959 --> 00:09:40.300
repair the relationship.

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:44.660
If they could not fix their marriage within
the three months, he could get a divorce.

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:49.149
Hitler ordered Lida Baarova her to leave Germany
within 24 hours, giving her a one way ticket

00:09:49.149 --> 00:09:50.220
to Prague.

00:09:50.220 --> 00:09:54.470
After this incident Joseph Goebbels was no
longer one of Hitler’s favorite men, his

00:09:54.470 --> 00:09:57.550
wife hated him, and his lover was gone.

00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:02.339
He was no longer invited over for dinner to
Hitler’s place, and they barely spoke.

00:10:02.339 --> 00:10:06.920
The other higher Nazi ups believed that Goebbels
had become weak, and that he was going insane.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:11.189
They questioned his loyalty, and he was no
longer seen as the powerful man he once was.

00:10:11.189 --> 00:10:23.100
If he wanted to be back in good graces with
Hitler, he would need to do something extreme.

00:10:23.100 --> 00:11:07.960
Inciting Hate Against the Jews
Goebbels was desperate to regain Hitler’s

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:08.960
trust again.

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:13.569
So, in 1939, he incited a mob by publishing
a fake story in the newspaper that a German

00:11:13.569 --> 00:11:16.740
man has been shot by a Jewish man in Paris.

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:20.480
He spoke in the streets, claiming that Jews
were trying to destroy society.

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:23.920
He lead an angry mob to burn down a synagogue.

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:27.569
That same year, he traveled to Poland with
a documentary film crew to show what life

00:11:27.569 --> 00:11:29.589
was like inside of a Jewish ghetto.

00:11:29.589 --> 00:11:33.809
The people living in the ghetto had sunken
faces, wore rags, and were generally dirty

00:11:33.809 --> 00:11:34.809
and sick.

00:11:34.809 --> 00:11:38.230
We now know that this is because the Nazis
forced them into the inhumane conditions in

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:39.279
the first place.

00:11:39.279 --> 00:11:43.149
However, Goebbels took this as an opportunity
to compare them to animals, saying that they

00:11:43.149 --> 00:11:45.300
were choosing to live that way.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:49.899
He said that they are less than human, and
that they need to be exterminated.

00:11:49.899 --> 00:11:54.629
This film was called The Eternal Jew, and
it premiered in 1940.

00:11:54.629 --> 00:11:58.459
In this movie, he tried to say that Jews were
all criminals, and that if The Nazis ever

00:11:58.459 --> 00:12:02.480
lost the war, then they may even take over
the world, forcing the German people to live

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:03.480
in squalor.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:08.300
He said, “Humanity would sink into eternal
darkness, it would fall into a dull and primitive

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:10.450
state, were the Jews to win this war.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:15.129
They are the incarnation of that destructive
force that in these terrible years has guided

00:12:15.129 --> 00:12:21.519
the enemy war leadership in a fight against
all that we see as noble, beautiful, and worth

00:12:21.519 --> 00:12:22.519
keeping.

00:12:22.519 --> 00:12:24.480
For that reason alone the Jews hate us.

00:12:24.480 --> 00:12:29.319
They despise our culture and learning, which
they perceive as towering over their nomadic

00:12:29.319 --> 00:12:30.319
worldview.

00:12:30.319 --> 00:12:36.790
They fear our economic and social standards,
which leave no room for their parasitic drives.”

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:40.940
This documentary genuinely frightened the
German people, and they felt that concentration

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:43.249
camps were justified.

00:12:43.249 --> 00:12:47.209
After visiting Auschwitz in person, Joseph
Goebbels wrote that he death and torture of

00:12:47.209 --> 00:12:52.079
these prisoners was so gruesome, that he did
not even want to write the details in his

00:12:52.079 --> 00:12:53.079
private journal.

00:12:53.079 --> 00:12:57.829
He wrote, “It may be barbaric, but they
truly deserve it.”

00:12:57.829 --> 00:13:01.790
All of his efforts to incite hate against
the Jewish people actually paid off, and Adolf

00:13:01.790 --> 00:13:04.550
Hitler begin to trust Joseph Goebbels once
again.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:09.279
Their mutual hate was enough to repair their
friendship, but it was at the cost of millions

00:13:09.279 --> 00:13:10.279
of lives.

00:13:10.279 --> 00:13:14.999
At this point, Hitler began to trust Joseph
Goebbels with more decisions in the government,

00:13:14.999 --> 00:13:17.620
and he had even more power than he ever did
before.

00:13:17.620 --> 00:13:21.940
Hitler stopped making so many public appearances,
and allowed Goebbels to speak on his behalf,

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:22.940
instead.

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:25.290
He even gave him the authority to declare
war.

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:29.040
In 1941, Joseph Goebbels announced over the
radio that Germany would be going to war with

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:30.360
the Soviet Union.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:33.910
Goebbels did exactly what he did when he filmed
The Eternal Jew in Poland.

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:38.009
He brought yet another documentary film crew
to show Soviet prisoners who were living in

00:13:38.009 --> 00:13:40.170
the mud, looking half-dead.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:44.779
He claimed that this is how the Russian people
normally lived, and that the Bolshevik party

00:13:44.779 --> 00:13:47.790
was controlled by Jews who were trying to
take over the world.

00:13:47.790 --> 00:13:52.259
He successfully convinced the German public
that by fighting Russia, they were fighting

00:13:52.259 --> 00:13:53.459
for their freedom.

00:13:53.459 --> 00:13:57.989
He stood in front of a crowd of thousands
of people at a sports stadium in Berlin, saying

00:13:57.989 --> 00:14:00.889
that there needed to be a “total war”.

00:14:00.889 --> 00:14:03.420
He was met with thunderous applause.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:08.660
But, as you may already know, Germany’s
invasion of Russia is what lead to their downfall.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:13.260
The Germans could not handle the harsh winters,
and the United States had joined the Allied

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.260
Forces.

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:18.720
Italy switched over the the Allies, as well,
and their stronghold in World War II was suddenly

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.309
falling like dominos.

00:14:20.309 --> 00:14:28.249
Descending into Madness
Now, you can probably tell so far in this

00:14:28.249 --> 00:14:31.750
story that Joseph Goebbels was always a bit
crazy.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:36.369
But after the invasion of the Soviet Union,
his mental state became more and more unraveled.

00:14:36.369 --> 00:14:41.529
He encouraged elderly man and young boys to
sacrifice their lives for the sake of Germany,

00:14:41.529 --> 00:14:45.259
and baby-faced child soldiers were sent off
to war.

00:14:45.259 --> 00:14:50.120
He said that every man, woman, and child needed
to be ready to die for the motherland.

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:54.829
According to Wilfred von Oven, a man who worked
on Joseph Goebbels’ staff, they were at

00:14:54.829 --> 00:14:57.959
a meeting when a bomb was dropped in the garden
of his house.

00:14:57.959 --> 00:15:00.139
The glass of all of the windows shattered.

00:15:00.139 --> 00:15:04.160
While everyone else on the staff ducked for
cover, Joseph Goebbels never flinched.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:08.590
He simply brushed the broken glass off of
his notes, and continued reading his speech,

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:09.959
as if nothing happened.

00:15:09.959 --> 00:15:15.260
He somehow remained completely composed on
the outside, while the panic was secretly

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:16.290
tearing him apart.

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:20.149
At the end of the war, Hitler told Goebbels
that he knew that they were going to lose

00:15:20.149 --> 00:15:21.149
the war.

00:15:21.149 --> 00:15:24.329
He was preparing to go to his bunker, with
plans to commit suicide.

00:15:24.329 --> 00:15:28.069
He appointed Goebbels as the new Chancellor
of Germany, and he wanted him to stay behind

00:15:28.069 --> 00:15:30.759
and run the government once the Allies invaded.

00:15:30.759 --> 00:15:34.839
Goebbels was so devoted, that he refused to
live without Hitler.

00:15:34.839 --> 00:15:39.179
He told his wife and all of his children to
clean themselves, put on their Sunday best,

00:15:39.179 --> 00:15:41.279
and go to the Fuhrer's bunker.

00:15:41.279 --> 00:15:45.199
On April 30, Hitler committed suicide, leaving
Goebbels as Germany’s new chancellor.

00:15:45.199 --> 00:15:48.000
It’s not a position he would hold for long.

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:52.480
The following day, Goebbels and Magda poisoned
their six children, before ending their own

00:15:52.480 --> 00:16:08.539
lives as well.

